  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with Scotland&apos;s climate justice principles, Climate Just Communities Zambia takes a community- led, participatory approach to building climate resilience in communities in Zambia. Interventions are being delivered across seven key areas: climate resilient agriculture, economic development, water access, sanitation and hygiene, natural resource management, disaster risk reduction, gender equality, disability and social inclusion, and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
